{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d6d6006945d280a857","chatId":"c1f3534cd44342329c30504d4b4f9329","sessionId":null,"userId":69025,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":994,"promptTokens":1495,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:30"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003592358113568067,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d6d6006945d280a856","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369750609,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:30","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d6d6006945d280a856","chatId":"c1f3534cd44342329c30504d4b4f9329","sessionId":null,"userId":69025,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n乔安妮很漂亮且受人欢迎。她希望能按照自己的心意找到一个伴侣。可是，她一直有收到匿名的爱慕者寄送的情书。每天早上，她都会看到她的储物柜被堆积了如山的信件。对此，她深呼吸，从一数到五，之后便带着笑容去上课。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，乔安妮最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 气恼\nB) 愧疚\nC) 开心\nD) 自豪\nE) 钦佩\nF) 激动\n\n## 问题 2\n乔安妮为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 乔安妮想自己找一个伴侣，但是经常有匿名的爱慕者联系她\nB) 乔安妮不喜欢收到任何形式的信件\nC) 乔安妮在她的学校里找不到任何她喜欢的人\nD) 乔安妮喜欢拥有许多的仰慕者","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003592358113568067,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d6d6006945d280a857","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369750607,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:30","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"fcecc55c3ee040efadea239de8cd28cc"}